    {id=1,name="Brawn",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=15,desc="This ability raises your base Strength by 2 points for each ability level."},
    {id=2,name="Stonestride",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="Your footing turns aside the worst of a blow. Reduces the damage of each melee hit against you by 2, 4, 7, 10 and 14 points."},
    {id=3,name="Unyielding",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="You are harder to land a blow upon. Increases your chance to avoid melee attacks by 2, 4, 6, 8 and 11."},
    {id=4,name="Bloodied Bash",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="You drink from the wounds your shield opens. Bash and Slam heal you for 25, 40, 55, 70 and 85 percent of the damage they deal."},
    {id=5,name="Sharpened Wit",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=15,desc="This ability raises your base Intelligence by 2 points for each ability level."},
    {id=6,name="Aegis Reflex",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="Every blow your armour turns aside is remembered. Deflections build a reserve, and when a blow finally lands it strengthens the next heal you receive by up to 10, 18, 28, 40 and 60 percent."},
    {id=7,name="Command Presence",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=15,desc="This ability raises your base Charisma by 2 points for each ability level."},
    {id=8,name="Overflowing Grace",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="Healing that would have been wasted is not wasted. Healing past a target maximum health wraps them in a shield that absorbs melee damage, converting 10, 18, 18, 25 and 25 percent of the excess. The third rank makes the shield last longer, and at the fifth rank a shield that is spent entirely leaves behind a brief renewal."},
    {id=9,name="Triage Instinct",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="You heal hardest where it is needed most. Heals cast on a target below 35 percent health are increased by 6, 10, 10, 15 and 15 percent. From the third rank those heals are also far more likely to critical, and at the fifth rank a critical heal on a dying target returns a portion of its mana."},
    {id=10,name="Mender's Echo",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="Your healing carries. A direct heal echoes onto the most wounded ally near your target for 8, 12, 12, 18 and 18 percent of the amount healed. The third rank reaches a second ally at reduced strength, and at the fifth rank the echo itself can critical."},
    {id=11,name="Cleansing Renewal",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="Curing is itself a kindness. Removing a poison, disease or curse also heals the target. The third rank leaves a short renewal behind, and at the fifth rank your next heal on that target lands harder."},
    {id=12,name="Borrowed Breath",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="You buy the dying a moment more. Healing a target below 15 percent health steadies them, reducing each melee hit against them by 3, 5, 6, 8 and 10 points. The third rank makes it last longer. At the fifth rank a blow that would have killed them instead leaves them standing, restored to a sliver of life and still able to be healed. You can avert death this way only once every 2 minutes."},
    {id=13,name="Quickening",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="Your casting quickens. Reduces the casting time of your spells by 2, 4, 6, 9 and 12 percent."},
    {id=15,name="Lean Rations",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=3,desc="This ability decreases your food consumption by 10, 25 and 50 percent."},
    {id=16,name="Executioner",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="You finish what you start. Blows against a target below 25 percent health strike for 3, 5, 5, 8 and 8 additional points, and the third rank widens that to 35 percent. At the fifth rank damage spent on an already dying foe carries to another enemy fighting you."},
    {id=18,name="Convalesce",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="Rest is worth more in company. While out of combat, you and your group recover an additional 4, 8, 12, 16 and 20 health and 3, 6, 9, 12 and 15 mana each tick."},
    {id=19,name="Killing Rhythm",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="Violence rewards a steady hand. Every melee blow you land strikes for 2, 4, 4, 6 and 6 additional points. From the third rank, staying on one target adds a further point for each blow in a row, and the fifth rank doubles how far that can climb."},
    {id=20,name="Frugal Casting",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=4,desc="This ability lowers the mana cost of spells by 2, 5, 10, and 15 percent."},
    {id=21,name="Relentless",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="You do not stop. Increases your chance to attack twice by 3, 6, 9, 12 and 15 percent, whether or not your class was ever taught how. At the fifth rank a double strike can carry into a third."},
    {id=23,name="Ruinous Cadence",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=3,desc="The three ranks of this ability give you a 2, 4, and 7 percent chance to land critical hits with your direct damage spells."},
    {id=25,name="Bloodletting",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="Your blows leave wounds that keep working after you have moved on. Melee hits cause bleeding. The third rank makes it last longer and the fifth rank doubles its severity. Bleeding ignores armour entirely."},
    {id=26,name="Flawless Recital",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=3,desc="This ability makes it impossible for you to fizzle a spell. The first level affects all spells below level 20.  The second, on all spells below level 35.  The third, on all spells below level 52."},
    {id=27,name="Deft Incantation",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=3,desc="This ability reduces the casting time of beneficial spells that have a duration longer than instant and a cast time greater than three seconds.  The ability levels reduce these casting times by 10, 25, and 50 percent."},
    {id=28,name="Shield Oath",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="Your defensive stance sharpens your blows and your presence. Increases melee damage by 4, 7, 10, 13 and 15 percent, and hate generated by 8, 12, 16, 20 and 25 percent."},
    {id=30,name="Sunder",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="Armour gives, if you keep hitting it. Each blow you land wears down your target guard against you, making your attacks less likely to be turned aside. From the third rank even a deflected swing wears it down. At the fifth rank a full set of marks guarantees your next blow lands. Wearing down a new target starts over."},
    {id=31,name="Steady Nerve",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=3,desc="This ability grants you a resistance bonus to fear type spells of 5, 10, and 25 percent. It also increases the chance of breaking fear earlier."},
    {id=32,name="Kindred Bond",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="What your companion is, you become a little of yourself. While your pet lives you carry its ward as well, whether that is the fire elemental burning aura, the air elemental swiftness, or the quiet clarity of a familiar. The second rank extends the ward to your group. The third and fourth make your companion hardier and surer of its blows, and at the fifth rank the ward outlives the pet by a minute. The ward is granted when the pet is summoned, so summon again after training this."},
    {id=33,name="Corrosion",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="What you inflict makes the next thing easier. Each tick of your damage over time has a 10, 15, 20, 25 and 30 percent chance to erode whichever resistance that spell is checked against, so fire wears down fire and poison wears down poison."},
    {id=34,name="Concussive Burst",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="When you are hurt badly the air cracks outward from you, stunning everything nearby. Triggers when you fall below 30 percent health, once every 5, 4, 3, 2 and a half, and 2 minutes. It will not hold the largest creatures."},
    {id=42,name="Quick Exit",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=3,desc="This ability reduces the casting time on your evacuation and succor spells by 10, 25, and 50 percent."},
    {id=44,name="Overload",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="Now and then the magic gets away from you. Direct damage spells have a 5, 10, 15, 20 and 25 percent chance to land for half as much again. This is its own roll and stacks with a critical rather than replacing one."},
    {id=47,name="Sanguine Frenzy",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="For 4 seconds, the damage your weapons deal is returned to you as health, three times over. The healing is capped at 8, 11, 14, 17 and 20 percent of your maximum health each time you use it, so no weapon is too fine and none too crude. Reusable every 45 seconds."},
    {id=48,name="Ready Blessing",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=3,desc="This ability reduces the casting time of many beneficial spells that have a duration by 10, 25, and 50 percent."},
    {id=49,name="Alembic",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=3,desc="This ability reduces your chances of failing alchemy combinations by 10, 25, and 50 percent."},
    {id=50,name="Second Wind",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="Spend the last of your stamina and turn it into will. Consumes all of your endurance and returns 40, 55, 70, 85 and 100 percent of it as mana. Mana over your maximum is lost, so do not use it while full. Usable once every 5 minutes."},
    {id=52,name="Fade",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="Slip out of the world attention. Everything currently angry at you forgets, and you are briefly unseen. In a group this hands whatever was hitting you to somebody else. Requires and consumes at least half your endurance. Usable once every 45 minutes."},
    {id=60,name="Iron Will",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="Spend everything at once and wear it. Your entire pool of mana is consumed and returned to you as absorption, at half its worth for the first two ranks and in full from the third. From the second rank your endurance is spent alongside it. The fourth rank turns aside spell damage as well as blows, and the fifth makes it last twice as long. Usable once every 30 minutes."},
    {id=73,name="Sanctified Blow",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="Strike your target senseless for a moment. Each blow that lands has a 20, 30, 30, 40 and 100 percent chance to leave a ward about you, absorbing melee damage equal to 2, 4, 6, 8 and 10 percent of your maximum health until it is spent. The third rank stuns for longer and holds tougher opponents, and at the fifth rank the ward is certain. Reusable every 30 seconds."},
    {id=75,name="Mana Shroud",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="Let the magic take the blow instead. 4, 8, 12, 16 and 20 percent of the damage you take is drawn from your mana rather than your health."},
    {id=78,name="Nothing Left to Fear",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=2,era=0,mr=1,desc="This ability will make you permanently immune to fear spells.",pr={{a=31,r=3}}},
    {id=81,name="Offhand Grace",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=2,era=0,mr=1,desc="This ability increases your chance to use dual wield successfully."},
    {id=89,name="Bracing",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="You are not easily moved. Blows can no longer shove you out of position. This holds against being pushed by weapons; it does not stop magic that hurls you."},
    {id=97,name="Enduring Grace",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="Even slow mercy can be sudden. Your healing over time gains a 10, 18, 26, 34 and 42 percent chance to critically heal, which no other ability of yours affects."},
    {id=103,name="Steady Hands",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=4,desc="This ability reduces your chance of failing on a poison combination by 10, 25, and 50 percent. It also reduces the time to apply poison by 2.5 seconds per ability level. Once one point is applied to this ability, you will never again fail in poison application."},
    {id=104,name="Backs to the Wall",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="The more of them there are, the harder you are to put down. Every enemy fighting you beyond the first reduces each melee blow against you by 1, 2, 2, 3 and 3 points, counting up to four of them. It does nothing at all when only one thing is attacking you."},
    {id=108,name="Run Them Down",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="Nothing you have your hands on gets to leave. Enemies fighting you will not turn and run, however badly the fight is going for them."},
    {id=111,name="Rally",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="Cut through the panic. Frees you and your whole group of fear, root and snare. Usable once every 3 minutes."},
    {id=114,name="Unbroken Concentration",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="Hold the thought whatever happens to the body. Greatly improves your chance to keep casting when struck, and at the fifth rank you cannot be interrupted at all."},
    {id=119,name="Quiet Recovery",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=2,era=0,mr=1,desc="This ability will give you one additional point of mana and hit point regeneration."},
    {id=120,name="Hardened Frame",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=2,era=0,mr=2,desc="This ability will give you additional improvements in your Natural Durability, Avoidance Boost, and Mitigation Boost."},
    {id=122,name="Tumbler's Instinct",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=3,desc="This ability will reduce the damage that you take from falling."},
    {id=124,name="Wild Thrust",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=2,era=0,mr=1,desc="This ability will allow you to do minimal backstab damage on your backstab attempt, even if you are not positioned behind the monster."},
    {id=128,name="Communion",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="Pour out your strength for everyone standing with you. Heals your entire group at once, for an amount that grows with your level. Usable once every 5 minutes."},
    {id=141,name="Tanaan Schooling",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=6,desc="Training with the sages and merchants of New Tanaan gives adventurers the chance to hone their crafting skills.  For each rank of this ability that you purchase, you are able to raise an additional trade skill past its Specialization level (200).  (This ability applies to Baking, Blacksmithing, Brewing, Fletching, Jewelcraft, Pottery, and Tailoring.)"},
    {id=142,name="Weathered",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="Armour is no help against fire. Reduces the damage you take from spells and from anything that strikes an area by 2, 4, 6, 8 and 11 percent."},
    {id=143,name="Planeforged",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=3,desc="The planes demand a certain hardiness of those who adventure within.  Each rank of this ability adds an additional 1.5% to your maximum hit points.  You gain the ability to train an additional rank at levels 61, 63, and 65."},
    {id=144,name="Far Sight",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="Distance is its own armour. Increases the range of your spells by 5, 10, 15, 20 and 25 percent."},
    {id=150,name="Word Perfect",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=21,desc="This ability makes it impossible for you to fizzle spells up to a certain level.  Rank 1 - level 54.  Rank 2 - level 56.  Rank 3 - level 58.  Rank 4 - level 62.  Rank 5 - level 64.  Rank 6 - level 66.  Rank 7 - level 67.  Rank 8 - level 69.  Rank 9 - level 71.  Rank 10 - level 72.  Rank 11 - level 74.  Rank 12 - level 76. Rank 13 - 79. Rank 14 - 80. Rank 15 - 81. Rank 16 - 82. Rank 17 - 83. Rank 18 - 84. Rank 19 - 85. Rank 20 - 86. Rank 21 - 87. Rank 22 - 88. Rank 23 - 89. Rank 24 - 90. Rank 25 - 91. Rank 26 - 92. Rank 27 - 93. Rank 28 - 94. Rank 29 - 95. Rank 30 - 96.",pr={{a=26,r=3}}},
    {id=154,name="Practiced Grace",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="Practice tells. Your spells cost 3, 5, 7, 9 and 11 percent less mana."},
    {id=170,name="Disengage",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="Break contact and run. Frees you of root and snare and greatly increases your movement for a few seconds. It turns aside no damage whatsoever, so you must actually leave. Requires and consumes at least half your endurance. Usable once every 45 minutes."},
    {id=173,name="Last Stand",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="Set your feet and refuse to fall. For 8, 10, 12, 14 and 15 seconds nothing can reduce you below a fifth of your maximum health. Requires and consumes at least half your endurance, so spending that endurance elsewhere leaves you without it. Usable once every 45 minutes."},
    {id=180,name="Reprieve",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=5,desc="Find a second breath. Restores 20, 27, 34, 42 and 50 percent of your maximum health and frees you of root and snare. It turns aside no damage at all, so it buys you an escape rather than a stand. Requires and consumes at least half your endurance. Usable once every 45 minutes."},
    {id=186,name="Feral Cadence",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=14,desc="Each rank in this ability improves your chance of performing a double attack in any given combat round."},
    {id=187,name="Song of Blades",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=11,desc="This ability grants you a chance of performing a double attack in any given combat round.  Additional ranks improve your chance of performing the double attack."},
    {id=188,name="Oathblade",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=6,desc="This ability grants you an increased chance of performing a double attack in any given combat round.  You gain the ability to train an additional rank at levels 61, 63, and 65 and an additional three ranks at level 70."},
    {id=189,name="Redoubled",icon=155,cls=65535,cost=1,era=0,mr=6,desc="Each rank of this ability grants you an increased chance of performing a double attack in any given combat round."},
